---
layout: base
title: 'CodiceSolidale — Technology for the Common Good'
description: 'We bring together developers, designers, communicators and volunteers to build digital tools with social impact. Join the CodiceSolidale community.'
permalink: /en/
lang: en
locale: en_GB
---

<div class="wrapper">

  {# ── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <header class="full | section spot-color-theme-primary">
    <div class="section__inner flow region" style="--region-space: var(--space-xl-2xl);">
      <div class="prose wrapper flow" style="text-align: center;">
        <h1 class="gradient-text">Technology for the Common Good</h1>
        <p class="text-step-1">
          We bring together developers, designers, communicators and volunteers
          to build digital tools with social impact.<br>
          <strong>Anyone can contribute.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="cluster" style="justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-s);">
          <a href="/en/join/" class="button">Join us</a>
          <a href="/en/projects/" class="button" data-variant="ghost">Explore projects</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% svg "divider/waves", null, "divider" %}
  </header>

  {# ── HOW IT WORKS ─────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow">
      <h2 class="text-center" style="--flow-space: 0;">How it works</h2>
      <div class="grid" style="--grid-min-item-size: 14rem; margin-block-start: var(--space-l);">
        <div class="flow">
          <p class="text-step-3" aria-hidden="true">💡</p>
          <h3>Nonprofits publish ideas</h3>
          <p>Nonprofit organizations share their digital needs: apps, websites, management and communication tools.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow">
          <p class="text-step-3" aria-hidden="true">👩‍💻</p>
          <h3>Volunteers join</h3>
          <p>Developers, designers, communicators and enthusiasts find the project that matches their skills and availability.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow">
          <p class="text-step-3" aria-hidden="true">🚀</p>
          <h3>We build together</h3>
          <p>The team collaborates in an agile, open source way, with mentoring support for newcomers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow">
          <p class="text-step-3" aria-hidden="true">❤️</p>
          <h3>Communities benefit</h3>
          <p>Software is delivered free of charge, with open source code and full documentation for those who take over management.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── WHY JOIN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="full | section spot-color-theme-secondary">
    <div class="section__inner flow region">
      <div class="wrapper flow">
        <h2 class="text-center" style="--flow-space: 0;">Why join</h2>
        <div class="grid" style="--grid-min-item-size: 16rem; margin-block-start: var(--space-l);">
          <article class="flow">
            <h3>🌍 Make a difference</h3>
            <p>Your contribution concretely helps people in need, humanitarian organizations and vulnerable communities around the world.</p>
            <a href="/en/join/" class="button">Start now</a>
          </article>
          <article class="flow">
            <h3>📈 Grow professionally</h3>
            <p>Work on real projects, learn new technologies and build a recognizable open source portfolio seen by recruiters and collaborators.</p>
            <a href="/en/projects/" class="button">View projects</a>
          </article>
          <article class="flow">
            <h3>🤝 Meet amazing people</h3>
            <p>Join a global network of people united by the same passion: using technology to improve the world.</p>
            <a href="/en/about/" class="button">Learn about us</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% svg "divider/edgy", null, "divider" %}
  </section>

  {# ── FEATURED PROJECTS ────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow">
      <h2 class="text-center" style="--flow-space: 0;">Featured Projects</h2>
      <p class="text-center">Concrete tools built by our community for organizations that need them.</p>
      <div class="grid" style="--grid-min-item-size: 15rem; margin-block-start: var(--space-l);">
        <custom-card clickable>
          <h3 slot="headline"><a href="/en/projects/">Emergency App</a></h3>
          <p slot="content">Alert and coordination system for the local Red Cross: volunteer management, scheduling and real-time incident tracking.</p>
          <footer slot="footer">React Native · Node.js · PostgreSQL</footer>
        </custom-card>
        <custom-card clickable>
          <h3 slot="headline"><a href="/en/projects/">Food Sharing Platform</a></h3>
          <p slot="content">Connects supermarkets and restaurants with community canteens to redistribute surplus food and reduce waste.</p>
          <footer slot="footer">Vue.js · Python · Redis</footer>
        </custom-card>
        <custom-card clickable>
          <h3 slot="headline"><a href="/en/projects/">Education Portal</a></h3>
          <p slot="content">Free e-learning platform for children in disadvantaged areas, with offline content and multilingual support.</p>
          <footer slot="footer">Eleventy · PWA · IndexedDB</footer>
        </custom-card>
        <custom-card clickable>
          <h3 slot="headline"><a href="/en/projects/">Accessibility Tools</a></h3>
          <p slot="content">Browser extensions and libraries to make NGO websites accessible to visually impaired users.</p>
          <footer slot="footer">JavaScript · WCAG 2.2 · ARIA</footer>
        </custom-card>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center" style="margin-block-start: var(--space-l);">
        <a href="/en/projects/" class="button">View all projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── IMPACT ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="full | section spot-color-theme-primary">
    <div class="section__inner region">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <h2 class="text-center" style="color: var(--color-text);">Our Impact</h2>
        <div class="grid text-center" style="--grid-min-item-size: 10rem; margin-block-start: var(--space-l);">
          <div class="flow">
            <p class="text-step-4 font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text);">250+</p>
            <p>Active volunteers</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flow">
            <p class="text-step-4 font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text);">45</p>
            <p>Completed projects</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flow">
            <p class="text-step-4 font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text);">120k</p>
            <p>People helped</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flow">
            <p class="text-step-4 font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text);">18</p>
            <p>Countries reached</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% svg "divider/waves", null, "divider" %}
  </section>

  {# ── BLOG PREVIEW ─────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <section class="full | region">
    <div class="prose wrapper flow">
      <h2>From the blog</h2>
      <p>News, impact stories and guides from our community.</p>
      <div class="feature | region" style="--region-space: var(--space-l);">
        <custom-masonry layout="50-50">
          {% set itemList = collections.allPosts %}
          {% asyncEach item in itemList.slice(0, 4) %}
            {% set headingLevel = "h3" %}
            {% include "partials/card-blog.njk" %}
          {% endeach %}
        </custom-masonry>
      </div>
      <p><a href="/blog/" class="button">All posts</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
